"Wizard's Council": {
  "index": 0,
  "category": "rituals",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Ritual of the Wizard's Council"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This ritual summons a conclave from the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Ancient Council of Wizards",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nBy doing so, I am offering to align myself with the council in exchange for access to their knowledge of higher magics.\n\nOnce I have summoned the council, I must stand in the center of the circle to receive their blessing, if I believe I am worthy.\n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Allying oneself with such entities will almost assuredly make enemies of others.",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n\nAlternatively, performing this ritual in a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Council Great Hall",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " will challenge the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Senior Council",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " to a duel. While they almost assuredly will not accept such a challenge, I may instead draw the attention of a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Council Warden",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
    {
      "type": "ritual",
      "location": "mna:rituals/ancient_council"
    }
  ]
}